      "standard_id": "MCP_v2.0",
      "name": "Marine Community Profile (MCP) v2.0",
      "description": "A community profile of ISO 19115/19139 for marine geographic datasets. Provides mandatory, conditional and optional metadata element guidance, extensions to ISO 19115 (including codelists and enumerations), MCP XML schemas (XSDs), vocabularies (e.g. collection method, descriptive keywords), XML fragments and implementation guidance."
    },
    {
      "standard_id": "ISO_19115_19139",
      "name": "ISO 19115 / ISO 19139 (geographic metadata and XML encoding)",
      "description": "The ISO standard for geographic information metadata (ISO 19115) and its XML implementation/encoding (ISO 19139). The MCP manual is explicitly a profile of ISO 19115/19139 and includes discussion of extensions to ISO 19115 elements and codelists and how MCP maps onto the ISO schemas."
    }
  ],
